  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b0a3391bba511ef262cf524bcec472a6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1.2.1.0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Features:
  - Reworked Sign Up and Sign In.
  - Time Attack Event. Silverstone Racing, show the fastest lap time and claim a limited reward.
  - User Profile. Spectator Mode in Multiplayer
  - Updated Arrow Control's Sensitivity
  - Physics Rework
  - Engine Sounds Check in New Cars section
  - 'Garage car positions are now saved on the spot. Reset in the slot manager tab if needed. '
  - Racing Mode Camera updates
  - Ragdoll. Players are thrown out of the car in high-speed car accidents (no harm)
  - Character's inertia and head animation towards the player's camera or other players
  - Sound. Wind Sound ambient while driving added.
  - Interactive Map
  - Cloudness settings. Dynamic change of the clouds from clear sky to cloudy.
  - Wheel Blur. The rims are now blurred at high speed (high graphics or higher)
  - 'Racing mode: F1 class added'
  - Delete Car moved to Slot Manager
  Items:
  - 'New location: Tropics'
  - 'Reworked location: Road to Desert'
  - Updated Silverstone racing area
  Fix:
  - Racing Mode. NPC Rebalance
  - Characters' body parts not rendering issue fixed
  - UI. Arrow Controls increased the interaction area
  - iOS. Earpods Bluetooth connection fixes
  - iOS. Thai language support added
  - Game Optimization
  - General Bug Fixes
  - Car and Sound Fixes
